# Phase 2/4 CLI acceptance — counting, morphology read tools, graph surfaces.
#
# Segment 2 of 2 (host-backed, D-13): the segment-1 import has reached its
# host-owned terminal state. Counting targets come from `test-edition-min`;
# morphology tools have no active dataset (typed unavailability); graph
# commands validate inputs without touching canonical text.

```console
$ qai quran activate test-edition-min@0.1.0 --yes
activated test-edition-min@0.1.0 (generation 1)

```

```console
$ qai quran forms rebuild test-edition-min@0.1.0
rebuilt forms for quran-edition:test-edition-min@0.1.0: 14 ayahs, 64 tokens, 18 skeletons (generation 1)
MV-018 canonical-unchanged: pass (sha256:235795cb218c2df44496265b4ba5c3377d48944cb28cc4ff64c6104770932704)
provenance: prov-forms-test-edition-min-0.1.0-g1-75e0e98f12bf

```

An unknown profile is a usage error before any query runs.

```console
$ qai quran count frequency ويت --profile L9.nope
? 2
error: unknown counting profile: L9.nope

```

Hapax requires a countable profile and states it prominently.

```console
$ qai quran count hapax --profile L3.diacritics
? 0
profile L3.diacritics: [..] hapax form(s)

```

Morphology read tools are typed-unavailable with no active dataset.

```console
$ qai quran morphology datasets
no morphology datasets registered

```

```console
$ qai quran morphology root كتب
? 5
error: no active morphology dataset for root search; import and activate one first

```

The L7 affix path answers without a dataset and labels its backend.

```console
$ qai quran morphology affix ثش --profile L7.affix
? 0
affix ثش: [..] hit(s)

```

Graph inspection validates the input file before anything else.

```console
$ qai quran graph inspect --file missing-graph.json
? 5
error: read missing-graph.json: [..]

```

Morphology diff validates dataset selectors and reports an unregistered dataset
with a typed not-found error.

```console
$ qai quran morphology diff missing@0.1.0 other@1.0.0
? 5
error: unknown dataset 'missing:0.1.0': dataset is not registered

```

The additive top-level root browse command is typed-unavailable without an active
morphology dataset.

```console
$ qai quran root list
? 5
error: no active morphology dataset for root browse; import and activate one first

```

Root and lemma frequency are typed-unavailable without an active lexicon
(SC4 closes only once a dataset is activated; never an empty report).

```console
$ qai quran count root-frequency tst-root
? 5
error: dataset unavailable for root frequency: import and activate a morphology dataset first

```

```console
$ qai quran count lemma-frequency lem-mixed --mode all-analyses
? 5
error: dataset unavailable for lemma frequency: import and activate a morphology dataset first

```

The `freq` alias counts surface forms under a profile (D-10).

```console
$ qai quran freq ويت
? 0
[..]: [..] occurrence(s) under L3.diacritics (checksum [..])

```

An unknown multi-analysis mode is a usage error before any query runs.

```console
$ qai quran count root-frequency tst-root --mode sideways
? 2
error: unknown multi-analysis mode: sideways (use single-source, all-analyses, or one-vote-per-token)

```
